      "writtenOn": "2026-11-02T23:21:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Validated the 12-test `faft-pd` + `EcStress` suite (including `ECPDPowerSwap.normal`, `ECPDConnect.normal`, `ECPDTrysrc.normal`, `PDConnectAsDFP.normal`, `PDResetHard.normal`, and `EcStress.pd`) on `hideo` (RAA489000 TCPC with Servo v4p1 in DTS mode). Let me know if there are additional DTS transition scenarios you\u0027d like checked on hardware.",
      "parentUuid": "fc90f509_6e149f83",
      "revId": "ba826679c375e83c5e4453c38c02cc7e405e5a89",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
